  en:{semanticOff:'Semantic search off',semanticOn:'Semantic search on',semanticGuideTitle:'How to search your documents',semanticGuideBody:'Turn on Semantic search in the chat to download the text search model (about 210 MB). Add a TXT, Markdown, CSV, JSON or text PDF to this chat and ask a question. Indexing runs locally and uses additional memory; the best passages are shown as sources. Images, audio and video are not supported in this preview. Works with local chat models and a WebGPU-capable browser.',semanticPreparing:'Preparing semantic search…',semanticDownloading:'Downloading search model: {file}',semanticIndexing:'Indexing passages: {done}/{total}',semanticGpuUnavailable:'Semantic search requires a browser with WebGPU.',semanticOnlyLocal:'Semantic search is available only with local chat models.'},
